  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Bishops&apos; media advocacy initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is geared towards enabling church leadership through the Bishops to engage in advocacy through civic education and mobilisation of citizens as well as encouraging non-violent participation of Kenyan citizens in devolved governance, local resource distribution and campaigns towards sustained service delivery. Through the project there will be sustained monitoring and surveillance of the actions of leaders. This engagement will be done through published bimonthly articles in the newspapers followed by conversations in other media outlets on governance issues led by the Bishops.</narrative>
  </description>
